From: Rekha Eswaran <rekha.eswaran@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2020 17:03:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] DRV_DPM_SW-303 - enhance alloc_bridge_port API for suibf
 bp_cpu_disable-flag

---
